      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B06",
      "act": "EXHIBIT",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "remotion",
        "motion": "illustrate",
        "remotion": {
          "pattern": "RealLayerStack",
          "props": {
            "layers": [
              {
                "title": "Instance Pre-filter",
                "sub": "keeps only questions the base model already gets right"
              },
              {
                "title": "Instance Creator",
                "sub": "generates the harder, evolved version"
              }
            ],
            "caption": "Both roles run on GPT-4"
          },
          "rendered": {
            "out": "media/B06.mp4",
            "at": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "estimated_duration_s": 16,
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B06.mp3",
      "narration_text": "The system runs on specialized GPT-4-powered agent roles. An Instance Pre-filter keeps only questions the base model already answers correctly — you can't tell if a later failure comes from the evolution or a pre-existing gap. Then an Instance Creator generates the harder version.",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "actual_duration_s": 18.79,
      "build": {
        "status": "VIDEO",
        "src": "media/B06.mp4",
        "filled_by": "media",
        "at": "2026-08-12T16:29:26"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B07",
      "act": "EXHIBIT",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "remotion",
        "motion": "illustrate",
        "remotion": {
          "pattern": "RealChipGrid",
          "props": {
            "items": [
              "Complex question — adds reasoning steps",
              "Adding noise — irrelevant or adversarial context",
              "+ four more reframing operations"
            ],
            "cols": 3,
            "caption": "Six reframing operations guide the evolution"
          },
          "rendered": {
            "out": "media/B07.mp4",
            "at": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "estimated_duration_s": 16,
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B07.mp3",
      "narration_text": "Six reframing operations guide that step. One example: adding noise — inserting irrelevant or adversarial sentences into the context. It tests whether a correct answer was real reasoning, or just a shortcut that only worked in a clean context.",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "actual_duration_s": 16.51,
      "build": {
        "status": "VIDEO",
        "src": "media/B07.mp4",
        "filled_by": "media",
        "at": "2026-08-12T16:29:26"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B08",
      "act": "EXHIBIT",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "remotion",
        "motion": "kinetic",
        "remotion": {
          "pattern": "SlateCard",
          "props": {
            "headline": "Most LLMs showed a performance decline once evaluated under the harder version.",
            "eyebrow": "THE RESULT",
            "topic": "VERIFIED, THEN TESTED"
          },
          "rendered": {
            "out": "media/B08.mp4",
            "at": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "estimated_duration_s": 16,
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B08.mp3",
      "narration_text": "A separate verifier agent checks each new instance is valid before it enters the suite. The result: most LLMs showed a performance decline against their original scores once evaluated under this harder version — the static numbers people were citing were partly an artifact of a stale test.",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "actual_duration_s": 18.77,
      "build": {
        "status": "VIDEO",
        "src": "media/B08.mp4",
        "filled_by": "media",
        "at": "2026-08-12T16:29:26"
      }
    },
    {
