      "estimated_duration_s": 14,
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B10.mp3",
      "narration_text": "The reusable shape here: a generator agent that creates new test cases, and a verifier agent that checks they're valid and non-trivial before they count. That pair is the core of nearly every automated eval-evolution system built so far.",
